{"id": "DeZfbS8P3hN", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"TITAN\" to get the full guide to build a game like this yourself.\n\nI just built this full Attack on Titan multiplayer game inside Claude Code.\n\nIt's a full game in Minecraft style.\n\nAnd it only took about an hour and $31 to build it.\n\nAll I did was ask Claude to build me a full game in Minecraft style.\n\nAnd it came back with a full game.\n\nYou either play as a soldier cutting down giant monsters.\n\nOr as one of the giants smashing through the wall.\n\nIt's built fully in JavaScript.\n\nIt runs straight from the browser.\n\nAnd I didn't have to write a single line of code.\n\nThen I asked it to add multiplayer through a Twilio relay.\n\nSo people from around the world can jump in and play together.\n\nAnd there are already some players in there right now.\n\nThink of it like having a complete game studio that builds the entire thing for you in about an hour.\n\nYou just describe what you want.\n\nThen Claude does all of the building for you.\n\nA game like this used to take a whole team months to make.\n\nNow anyone can build something like this.\n\nEven if you have never written code before.\n\n#claudecode #aigamedev #aiminecraft #attackontitan #aigames", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791816791, "like_count": 1406, "comment_count": 836, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1821058352238603a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.552, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOjvruVeII3awAjBGfSfaCIOzi9QLxuSFdjhithX04Pa9LxUWKbe0mlua5mQGvLtLWKl-8W_Pv312O7Smw6jfQMdt3yOXFlJs3Dyf8.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adow3_9Ssr8fxuL6x7EcEj--T1vCWIhgTul-bg4z2zMs5GdZR3nIF7_N3L0YaGnccvM&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=lGzsbHdREJ4Q7k